IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
UserCmd "awk -F ' ' '/gmail/ { print $(NF-2); exit; }' ~/.authinfo"
PassCmd "awk -F ' ' '/gmail/ { print $NF; exit; }' ~/.authinfo"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Subfolders Verbatim
# The trailing "/" is important
Path ~/.mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/gmail/Inbox

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
# Include everything
Patterns *
Sync All
Create Both
Remove Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *



